---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact Daniel's Lock & Key | Hollywood" description="Call Daniel for an active Hollywood lockout or send a scheduled request for rekeying, repair, or selected commercial work."><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="kicker">Talk directly with Daniel</p><h1>Tell Daniel what the lock is doing.</h1><p class="lede">For an active lockout, call <a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a>. Scheduled requests can use the form below.</p></div></section><section class="request" id="request"><div class="shell request-grid"><div><h2>What to prepare</h2><ul><li>Exact address, city, or ZIP</li><li>Home, rental, business, or passenger vehicle</li><li>Door, lock, and symptom</li><li>Proof of authorized access</li></ul></div><LeadForm/></div></section><section class="section shell"><h2>Hours listed on Google Maps</h2><ul><li>Sunday–Thursday: open 24 hours</li><li>Friday: 12:00 AM–7:00 PM</li><li>Saturday: 6:00 PM–12:00 AM</li></ul><p>These are the hours displayed on <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Daniel's+Lock+%26+Key+Service/@34.098,-118.33,12z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x8678d8d91696c383:0x8875ceccca924926!8m2!3d33.786671!4d-118.0032301!16s%2Fg%2F11nvtq3fl0">Daniel's Google Maps profile</a>, not a guaranteed arrival or service window. Call <a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a> to confirm availability for your address before visiting or requesting service.</p></section></BaseLayout>
